# Skills the Sentinella consumes from agents/_skills/.
# One name per line. Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
# The launcher (start-agent.sh) reads this file at boot and copies the
# listed skills into the agent's ~/.claude/skills/ runtime workspace.
# Private skills under agents/sentinella/_skills/ are copied separately
# without needing to be listed here.
tmux-send
rate-budget
throttle
# Wake-up ack: first command after every throttle pause. Without it the
# flag stays on NOTIFIED and the watchdog escalates on a healthy agent.
throttle-ack

# Emergency: spawn fresh DOTTORE quando rilevi che un agente smette di
# consumare token in piena finestra (sospetta zombie). Post-mortem
# 2026-05-18-capitano-zombie-night — la Sentinella vede usage=0% e
# può escalare al Dottore senza aspettare i 2h del watchdog.
spawn-doctor
